   "source": [
    "## Variables and basic types\n",
    "\n",
    "Python programs store data in variables.\n",
    "\n",
    "Built-in types:\n",
    "\n",
    "| Type/class | Meaning | Examples for values of this type |\n",
    "|---|---|---|\n",
    "| `int` | integer | `0`, `1`, `-1`, `2`, `-2`, `3`, `-3` |\n",
    "| `float` | rational number | `3.14`, `-0.001`, `8.0` |\n",
    "| `str` | string, sequence of characters | `\"Amir\"`, `\"!!!\"`, `\"45\"`, `\"ATTCG\"` |\n",
    "| `list` | sequence of elements | `[1, 2, 3]`, `[55, \"hello\", 55, -7]` |\n",
    "| `bool` | Boolean | `True`, `False` |\n"
   ]
  },
