    "## Main keypoints: dynamic typing\n",
    "\n",
    "In Python:\n",
    "- variables are not declared with a fixed type\n",
    "- a variable may later store a value of a different type\n",
    "\n",
    "This is often very convenient for beginners, because the notation stays simple.\n"
