   "source": [
    "## Strings and lists as sequences\n",
    "- String is a sequence of characters.\n",
    "- List is a sequence of elements (of any type).\n",
    "\n",
    "Both strings and lists support sequence operations.\n",
    "\n",
    "| Operator | Symbol | Example for strings | Example for lists |\n",
    "|---|---|---|---|\n",
    "| Concatenation | `+` | `\"droso\" + \"phila\"` | `[1,2,3] + [4,5]` |\n",
    "| Replication | `*` | `\"UAG\" * 8` | `[\"a\",4] * 3` |\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {
